{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"平台运营与演进","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-observability-slo","title":"平台可观测性与 SLO 体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/operations/platform-observability-slo","wordCount":1466,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-cost-governance","title":"平台成本治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/operations/platform-cost-governance","wordCount":1477,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-augmented-platform","title":"AI 增强的平台工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering-advanced/operations/ai-augmented-platform","wordCount":1634,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"平台运营与演进\">平台运营与演进</h1><p>本章关注平台上线之后的持续运营：可观测性与 SLO 体系保障平台可靠性、成本治理确保投资回报可量化、AI 增强能力代表平台的下一代演进方向。</p>\n<p>运营阶段是平台工程从&quot;项目&quot;变为&quot;产品&quot;的关键转折——项目有终点，产品没有。平台团队需要像运营一个 SaaS 产品一样运营内部平台：持续监控健康度、管理容量与成本、响应用户反馈、规划功能路线图。</p>\n<p>2026 年的新趋势是 AI 深度嵌入平台层：从智能 Scaffolding 到异常根因分析，AI 正在重新定义&quot;自助服务&quot;的边界。</p>\n"}